  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Desarrollo de Proyectos Rurales de Adaptacin al Cambio Climtico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Development of Rural Climate Change Adaptation Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es promover el desarrollo de actividades agrcolas resilientes al Cambio Climtico (CC), en sectores de alto riesgo climtico identificados por regiones, vulnerabilidades y cultivos clave. El objetivo especfico de desarrollo del programa es canalizar recursos crediticios, a travs de la red de Intermediarios Financieros (IF) de FIRA, a proyectos sustentables, de adaptacin y resiliencia de empresas del sector primario y las Micro, Pequeas y Medianas Empresas (MIPYME) de la agroindustria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to promote the development of agricultural activities resilient to Climate Change (CC), in high climate risk sectors identified by regions, vulnerabilities and key crops. The specific development objective of the program is to channel credit resources, through the network of Financial Intermediaries (FI) of FIRA, to sustainable, adaptation and resilience projects of companies in the primary sector and Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSME) of agrobusiness.</narrative>
  </description>
